OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cool and rather cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith occasional showers particularly
OL,7,Fin the morning and again late
OL,8,Fafternoon, more frequent across the
OL,9,Fnorth. Drier with a few bright
OL,10,Fintervals around lunchtime. Moderate
OL,11,Fnortherly breeze, fresh around Buchan
OL,12,Fcoasts.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloudy with showers or longer
OL,15,Fspells of rain in the evening.
OL,16,FBecoming generally drier overnight but
OL,17,Fstill cloudy with a few light showers.
OL,18,FStill breezy around the Buchan coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
