OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCool and mostly cloudy through
OL,6,Fthe day. A few light showers in the
OL,7,Fmorning then becoming dry through the
OL,8,Fafternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,11,FBrighter starts on Saturday and
OL,12,FSunday, but turning cloudier through
OL,13,Fthe afternoons with the odd shower.
OL,14,FDry with bright or sunny spells on
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
